    "detailed_description": "Play as a national secret agent blessed with extraordinary abilities designed to face disaster events. Entrusted with the crucial task of saving the nation's vital assets, you must navigate dangerous situations and make split-second decisions to ensure mission success. Equipped with special tools, you must confront perilous environments, using your skills to overcome obstacles and fulfill your duty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7f996dc7cd7c1c29b1d2c4f2c1f5eb02.poster.avif?t=1741817367\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7f996dc7cd7c1c29b1d2c4f2c1f5eb02.webm?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7f996dc7cd7c1c29b1d2c4f2c1f5eb02.mp4?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your mission unfolds against the backdrop of a city plunged into turmoil by a devastating disaster. As a national secret agent, you are thrust into the heart of the crisis, where molten lava courses through the streets, threatening to engulf everything in its path. With agility and precision, you must traverse the urban landscape, leaping across buildings to evade the relentless flow of magma. Amidst this perilous environment, your objective is clear: procure vital national assets and retrieve classified documents crucial for the nation's security and stability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/ba59b0010a6abd7c51e27de518e2c3f4.poster.avif?t=1741817367\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/ba59b0010a6abd7c51e27de518e2c3f4.webm?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/ba59b0010a6abd7c51e27de518e2c3f4.mp4?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As the intensity of the disaster escalates, your role as a national secret agent becomes even more vital. With the essential items and documents secured, the next phase of your mission begins. Maneuvering an evacuation vehicle through the debris-laden streets, you must navigate obstacles and hazards while racing against the clock to reach the safety of the designated zone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7bcdf9a186c660944fb24a613992638c.poster.avif?t=1741817367\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7bcdf9a186c660944fb24a613992638c.webm?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961300/extras/7bcdf9a186c660944fb24a613992638c.mp4?t=1741817367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Disaster Slayer offers numerous key features and content to ensure an immersive gaming adventure:<br>1. Navigate between buildings with parkour abilities.<br>2. Drive to the Safety Zone.<br>3. Experience an apocalyptic environment.<br>4. Enjoy a linear game design.<br><br>As for the content:<br>1. Collect various items.<br>2. Utilize 3 types of cars.<br>3. Embark on 20 challenging missions.",
